            <div class="goa data">
                <h2>Goa</h2>
                <p>The unofficial party place of India, Goa is more than that. It has a great legacy, history and
                    culture that are yet to be explored. But if beaches are what you are looking for, then the state has
                    that too. And that's why, <b>India tours</b> to Goa are a great option to explore the place,
                    according to your interests. <b>Goa holiday packages</b> are also popular because Goa is one of the
                    top places in the world when it comes to nightlife. Find several exciting <b>tour packages</b> and
                    other <b>India holiday packages</b> that let you try Goa's melange of watersports and other fun
                    activities.</p>
                <p>
                    <br>
                    <b>Best time to visit:</b> November to February
                </p>
                <p>
                    <br>
                    Best places to visit:
                    <br>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Calangute
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Baga
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Anjuna
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Miramar
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Palolem
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Panjim
                    </li>
                </ul>
                You can also include the offbeat Patnem Beach in your holiday tour packages, since it was listed amongst
                one of Asia's top 20 beaches.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="kerala data">
                <h2>Kerala</h2>
                <p>God's own country, Kerala has been a popular tourist destination in India. You can explore it all
                    with <b>India tours</b> to this marvellous destination. With suitable <b>tour packages</b>, you can
                    discover scenic seaside destinations and hill stations in Kerala. Whether you want to cruise on a
                    traditional houseboat in Alleppey, witness vibrant Kathakali dance performances, or rejuvenate with
                    authentic Ayurvedic wellness treatments, <b>Kerala holiday packages</b> cater to all kinds of
                    travelers. Find several exciting <b>tour packages</b> and other <b>India tour packages</b> that let
                    you experience Kerala's rich heritage, spice plantations, and mouth-watering coastal gastronomy.</p>
                <p>
                    <br>
                    <b>Best time to visit:</b> September to March
                </p>
                <p>
                    <br>
                    Best places to visit:
                    <br>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Sree Padmanabhaswamy Temple
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Francis CSI Church
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Paradesi Synagogue
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Eravikulam National Park
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Varkala Beach
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Athirappilly Waterfalls
                    </li>
                </ul>
                If you are planning India holiday packages in the state, then you must not miss out on its
                lip-smacking cuisine as well. Check your holiday tour packages and book accordingly.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="kashmir data">
                <h2>Kashmir</h2>
                <p>For decades, the Kashmir valley has attracted tourists from all over the world. If you can't plan a
                    vacation on your own, you should check out <b>India tours</b> for Kashmir to help you with an
                    unforgettable holiday. With the right <b>all India tour packages</b>, you can discover lush green
                    valleys, snow-covered peaks and gorgeous wildlife. Your <b>trip packages</b> must include the
                    Chenab, Sindh and Lidder valleys. Don't forget to buy a world-famous Kashmiri shawl and
                    one-of-a-kind handicrafts for your loved ones.</p>
                <p>
                    <br>
                    <b>Best Time to Visit:</b> March to August
                </p>
                <p>
                    <br>
                    Best Places to Visit:
                    <br>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Gulmarg
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Srinagar
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Dal Lake
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    You can also include the offbeat Gurez Valley, Doodhpathri, Bangus Valley, and Sinthan Top in your
                    holiday tour packages, since they were listed amongst some of the most serene and untouched
                    high-altitude hidden gems in Kashmir.
                </p>
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="rajasthan data">
                <h2>Rajasthan</h2>
                <p>If you are looking for mesmerising <b>India tours</b>, then Rajasthan is undoubtedly your destination
                    of choice. From its sprawling forts and historical landmarks to its signature architecture,
                    beautiful lakes and rich culinary traditions, the state is a must-try for the <b>best tour
                        packages</b> in the country. Your <b>trip packages</b> should include visits to several
                    historical monuments.</p>
                <p>
                    <br>
                    <b>Best Time to Visit:</b> November to February
                </p>
                <p>
                    <br>
                    Best Places to Visit:
                    <br>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Jaipur
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Udaipur
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Chittor
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    You can also include the offbeat Abhaneri Stepwell, Bhangarh Fort, Khuri Village, and Bundi in your
                    holiday tour packages, since they were listed amongst some of the most extraordinary historical and
                    cultural hidden gems in Rajasthan.
                </p>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="agra data">
                <h2>Agra</h2>
                <p>Home to the world-famous Taj Mahal, Agra offers an unforgettable glimpse into rich Mughal history,
                    architecture, and culture. Visitors can explore majestic forts, grand tombs, and bustling heritage
                    bazaars through tailored travel experiences.</p>
                <p>
                    <br>
                    <b>Best time to visit:</b> October to March
                </p>
                <p>
                    <br>
                    Best places to visit:
                    <br>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Taj Mahal
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Agra Fort
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Fatehpur Sikri
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Itmad-ud-Daulah (Baby Taj)
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Mehtab Bagh
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Akbar's Tomb
                    </li>
                </ul>
                You can also include the offbeat Mehtab Bagh sunset viewpoint in your holiday tour packages, since it
                was listed amongst one of the best locations for panoramic views of the Taj Mahal.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mumbai data">
                <h2>Mumbai</h2>
                <p>The bustling City of Dreams, Mumbai is a grand fusion of colonial architecture, vibrant street life,
                    iconic coastal drives, and rich Bollywood culture. From historic landmarks overlooking the Arabian
                    Sea to bustling local markets, the city offers dynamic travel options for every explorer.</p>
                <p>
                    <br>
                    <b>Best time to visit:</b> October to February
                </p>
                <p>
                    <br>
                    Best places to visit:
                    <br>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Gateway of India
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Marine Drive
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Terminus
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Elephanta Caves
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Colaba Causeway
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Juhu Beach
                    </li>
                </ul>
                You can also include the offbeat Banganga Tank in your holiday tour packages, since it was listed
                amongst one of the most serene historical hidden gems in South Mumbai.
                </p>
